    "content": "<p _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(26, 28, 30);\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Everyone, Google has gone absolutely crazy. They’ve just launched \"Antigravity,\" an ambitious new tool that will make you seriously question your $20/month subscription to Cursor or Claude.</span></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(26, 28, 30);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">The most shocking parts are the&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">price</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">performance</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">. Currently, all Antigravity plans are&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">free</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">, and you even get&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">unlimited access</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;to Google's latest model,&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Gemini 3 Pro</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">.</span></ms-cmark-node></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(26, 28, 30);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Agentic coding, which previously required complex steps like Linux installations, can now be installed on Windows with just a few clicks. The AI agent \"autonomously\" handles everything from web searches to writing code and even testing it in the browser.</span></ms-cmark-node></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(26, 28, 30);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">In today's video, I cover everything from installing Antigravity to a real-world \"Vibe Coding\" session where we redesign a landing page in seconds using Gemini 3 Pro. Experience it right now before they start charging for it!</span></ms-cmark-node></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(26, 28, 30);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">[Video Highlights]</strong><br _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"display: contents;\"></ms-cmark-node><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">🚀&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Unlimited Gemini 3 Pro:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;Use the highest-performance AI model without a monthly fee.</span><br _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"display: contents;\"></ms-cmark-node><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">💸&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Can it Replace Cursor?:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;A complete guide from installation to usage.</span><br _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"display: contents;\"></ms-cmark-node><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">🤖&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Self-Driving Agent:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;Automating everything from coding to website testing.</span><br _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"display: contents;\"></ms-cmark-node><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">🎨&nbsp;</span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Vibe Coding:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;Build websites just by talking, even with zero design skills.</span></ms-cmark-node></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(26, 28, 30);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2128354897=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c2128354897=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">[🔗 Relevant Links]</